  "description": "The hand process of building a sewn headband by looping coloured silk over a vellum, gut, or string core and crossing the strands to form a beaded ridge at the head and tail of a book. The worker keeps the bead tight and low on the leaves, tying the band down into the sections at intervals so it grips the spine and resists strain.",
